<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Dec 2.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Dec 2.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>     GMT----date----indicator---------period-----previous</p>
<p>    0930   6/12    CPI		   November   +2.4 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
